      "content": "counseling and planning... i dont know man. i've done the spreadsheets. i've looked at every possible way to cut back and it doesn't matter. the numbers literally don't work. no matter how much i work, the hole just stays the same size or gets bigger. it feels less like a \"struggle\" and more like a math problem that's already been solved, and the answer is just zero. it feels like there's no actual exit strategy, just more of the same until i'm too old to move.",
